            "data_max_age_days": 3,
            "provenance": "Open-Meteo (ECMWF-derived) reference evapotranspiration at 41.9N/-93.6W. A crop WATER-DEMAND proxy over one growing region — not a food-supply measurement, not global. Weakest link in the FOOD portfolio.",
            "unit": "mm_per_day_et0"
          }
        ]
      },
      "event_daily": {
        "min": 1,
        "freshness_days": 3,
        "sources": [
          {
            "id": "promoted_40653",
